  <para style="h">Beduru Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Beduru Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Beduru</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Bed</para>
  <para style="mt">Beduru Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihade hoji, shitu danlasan <char style="pn">Ximun-Beduru</char> mai Huda, jiuichen <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai gundanni tungo giezhi bijien mutun zhiguitu xianxin gieku bisan kunlade xin huaizho. <verse eid="2PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Nenjien, pinnan Huda, mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni tanikui tungo giezhi tande olon ire gie!<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Huda Uruzhi Sunghusan Kunla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Huda tebieji nenlighalane matan xienliande udu daokude keresanlai man ogizho. Goya famatu, gounighalane mai urusan hhei tanikughala ingiezho. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Enezighanyi tungo giezhi Huda zhiguitu, fugie dainni matande ogizho. Ingiedene nefuxinse iresan duyani qida olukuse tai likai gieghazhi Hudai tejiende hhantulaghazho. <verse eid="2PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Zhen ene yenyinde oluzhi ta xiacha giezhi xianxin gieku jiere gounii, gouni jiere erlini, <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>erlin jiere goyane kunzhi giekui, goyane kunzhi gieku jiere rennaini, rennai jiere xienliantui, <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>xienliantu jiere gaijiulade orekui, gaijiulade oreku jiere kunlade orekui olodogha. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Enela tande bizhi olodose mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani taniku jiere tai yama oronde wizhi xiogo witui ulie gholughane. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Kunde ene giedun uwoshi zinie chadashikui chanlazhi gholoshikui chanla dane, sugho niekielien wo. Daosan zuinini arughasei matazho. <verse eid="2PE 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Ingiese gaijiula, ta genjia xiacha giezhi Huda tai urusan, sunghusanyi khidunde gholugha. Ta enei giese ulie furane. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Ingiezhi giese mai Ezhan, yeshijiu jiuichen <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani chanqiku gojiade sunfande orone.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Ta ijin enelai mejiezhi ede bisan zhendao jiere khidunde beizho, ingieliuzhe bi enelai chan tande jilaghaye. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Bi sumulase bi amitu xienzide enelai tande jila ireghase indanji wo. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha made mejieghasan mutun mii shihou oloncha widakui bi mejiene. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Bi duya ijiedene ene shiqinlai tai chan jilaghane giezhi bi jinlianji xiacha giene.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexihani Famai Bijien Chujieghewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Bijien mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani fugie nenli, hhe ireku shiqinlai tande kieliekushi goude bienjisan yama genzi witu guhualai ese daghazho. Bijien hhei famatui qinsi uzhezhi daozho. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Zui famatu hhense shenqi irezhi "Eneshi bi oresan mii kewon wo, bi hhende xiqi wo." giezhi hhende kieliekude hhe ada Hudase zhigui, famani jienliewo. <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Bijien hhere zhiguitu ulade bikude ene shenqi asiman jierese iresanyi qinsi sonosuwo.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Matande pse xienzhila melie kieliesan genjia kekaotu kielien wine. Ta hhei zhuyi giese oluzho. Hheshi kharanide zhouisan zhula niekielien wo, ogheizhi eqiemaghaku hodun tai zhughede khizhetula zhouine. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Ta mejieku zui zhunyonishi ene wo, jinwun jieredu soyuji melie kieliesan kielienlai goyane isighala jieshi giese ulie olune. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Melie kieliesan kielienshi kunni isighala kieliesan pusho, Shenlin kunni zhughei gojiolughadene Hudai isii kielieghazho.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jia Loushi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Eqighandei bexinlai dunda jia xienzhila khizhesan mutun jianlai tai dundaye jia loushila khizhene. Hhela ghulazhi kunni widaghaku daolini ireghane. Hhela goyai shuisan Ezhanni ulie renjizhi widakude holune. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Ingieliuzhe olon kunla hhela lon kijiezhi hu giesanyi daghane. Hhelai yenyinghala zhendaoni sugiene. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Hhela tanxin giezhi ghudanghala tai jierese haochu ereine giezho. Huda hhelade eqighanse zui jinjizho, hhelai widaghakui danwu ulie giene.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Huda zui fanjisan qienxienlai ese rouliedene dozoheini khara nokiende bendazhi panjikui sagheighazho. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Pse eqighanku duyani ese rouliedene xienlian witu kunlai duyade hunshui ireghazhi zinie gundanni chonjisan <char style="pn">Nuhha</char>ni nie gie neiman kunyi feilieghawo. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Pse <char style="png">Sodoma</char>, <char style="png">Emola</char> ghua chenshide zui jinjidene sideragha funiesun gholughazhi 1 houku xienlian witu kunlade jingao giezho. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Zinie mouxien kunla hu giesande yuchou giesan gou kun <char style="pn">Lutei</char>ni jiuiwo. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Hhe gou kun hhelai dunda niudunie souzhi hhela giesan mouxiennilai chanlazhi sonosuse hhei gou zhugheni otuzho. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Ingiese Ezhan xienliantu kunyi shiikuse matugie jiuizhi gou witu kunyi feilieghadene panjiku udude faikui mejiene. <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>Tebieshi beyeni zannan nefuxinni daghasan kunla, pse qienlini yamacha ulie teisan kunlai genjia ingiene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Hhela jionaoghazhi goyane fugiede uzhezhi asiman jieredu famatulase ulie ayidene sugienema, <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>qienxienliuzhe fugie lilian, nenli bidene sugieku kielienghala Ezhanyi melie asiman jieredu famatulai ulie zhane. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Enezighan jia loushila olusanse alaku, yama sumula daku chushen mutun goya sugiesanne ulie mejiene, chushen mutun widane. <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Hhela gou wini giedene goyai jiere gou wini ireghazho. Hhela udu hu giese bayasukui wo giezho. Tanre hhantu ijiekude piendakui giezhi bayasuzho. Hhelashi goujia, cheiqisan wo. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Hhela jin piofen giekui ereizho, ulie beidene zui fanjine. Bixin kunlai miine. Hhelai zhughede tanxin gieku gon oluwo. Hhelashi kharakui wo. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Hhela zhen moni bendadene <char style="pn">Bier</char>ni kewon <char style="pn">Balan</char>ni moni daghazhi xiemacha echiwo. <char style="pn">Balan</char> zhendan witu baerde xiqi bidene <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>goya codasandene kheilaghawo. Enzheghe kielien kielie danema, kunni shenqighala kielien kieliezhi ene xienzhi fenjiulisei danlawo.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Enezighan kunlashi usu witu bula wo, honfen kei feiliesan u niekielien wo. Zui khara oronni hhelade zhunbei giezho. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Hhela yama oronde wiku fugie kielien kieliezhi hu gieku nefuxinghala hhezighan codasan shenhose jian likai giesan kunlai miizho. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Hhela kunlade ziyu ogine giezhi dain giezhoma, goyane qida olukude hoji danlazho. Kunni yan hanshiliese yande hoji danlazho. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Kunla mai Ezhan, yeshijiu jiuichen <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tanikughala duyani zannannise andadene zannanni pse hhelai jiohoro giezhi hanshiliese hhelai khuinashiku qinkon eqighankude ulie kurune. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Hhela zhen moni tanidene jienliesan zhiguitu minlinni bendase ulie mejiekuse da gou wo. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Kunla kieliesan kielien shuhua wo, hhelai jiere gholuwo, "Noghei kharei ire goya benzhesanne ijiene." "Wagha arughasan khighei pse shuwade ghoghoreine."<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ersa Ireku Ghujinlazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Mii orentula, eneshi bi tande huaisan ji 2 hui xin wo. Ene ghua xin dunda tai qixin giezhi loushi zhugheitai olodoghane giezho. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Zhiguitu xienzhila melie kieliesan kielienyi, pse tai shitulai tungo giezhi Ezhan, yeshijiu jiuichen ogisan minlinyi tai jila ireghane giezho. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Ta mejieku zui zhunyonishi ene wo, duya baraku xienzide uzhezhi xiniechen kunla khizhedene duranghalane giezhi uzhezhi xiniezhi <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/><char style="pn">"Ersa</char> irene giezhi dain giesan khala wine? Mai xienrenla fugusanse eli kutula yanyanjila man wine, zui melieshida zhayaghasanghala niekielien wo." giezhi kieliene. <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Hhela eqighandei Hudai kielienghala asimanni giesei, pse zemin ususe khizhezhi usughala gholusei nanxighan matazho. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>Hhe shihouku duyani usughala manjidene widaghawoma, <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>edeku asiman, zeminni yen Hudai kielienghala feilieghazhi xienlian witu kunlai panjizhi widaghaku hhe udu kurune. Hhe shihoude asiman, zeminni khanghala tulie widaghane.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Mii orentula, enei ta bu mata, Ezhan uzhese niudushi 1000 nien wo, 1000 nienshi niudu wo. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Ezhan niezhan kunla sumulasan mutun dain giesanne danwu giezhi ulie chenjighakui pusho. Shijishan hhe tai rennai giezhi nieda ulie widaghadene jien kunlai geizhen gieghaku duran wo. <verse eid="2PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Ezhanni udu ghughei mutun irene. Hhe udude nie fugie shenqi irese asiman wida khine. Asiman jieredulai khanghala tulie widaghane. Zemin, zemin jiere giesanlai man widaghane. <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Yanyanjila man ingie widase ta matunie kun danlane? Ta indan zhiguide, xienliande udu daokuni wo. <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Hudai udui panjizhi ghujighan ire gie. Hhe udu kuzhese asimanyi khan tulie widaghane, asiman jieredulai tulie xiui widaghane. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Matan Huda dain giesan mutun gundanni durusan shini asiman, shini zeminni sagheizho.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Ingiese mii orentula, ta ene shiqinlai sagheise xiacha giezhi goyane bu zannanshighadene yama kheilakui wizhi Hudare heqishi. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Mai Ezhan rennai giekushi jiuiku jihui wo giezhi sumula. Zhen matan oresan gaijiu <char style="pn">Baolo</char> zhao Huda hhende ogisan aghelighala tande xin huaisan mutun wo. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Hhei xinla jiere man enezighan shiqinlai kieliezho. Xin jiere niezhanlai dunjireku chijiashi erlin witu, undan witu kunla psedu jinwun mutun codazhi lijie giedene goyane widaghawo. <verse eid="2PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Ingiese mii orentula, ta enei eqighan mejiese goude xioxin gie. Pse mouxien kunlai codasan tai miidene goya undanlasan oronsene anda boune. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Ta mai Ezhan, yeshijiu jiuichen <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani nenjien, taniku jiere henda. Kuaikui edese chanqi hhende ogi. Amine!<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
